ountry\":\"Brazil\",\"description\":\"A road trip through São Paulo's legendary sports arenas. We'll visit Allianz Parque, home of Palmeiras, Morumbi, where São Paulo FC plays, the historic Pacaembu stadium, Canindé, the grounds of Portuguesa, the Ibirapuera Gymnasium, a hub for volleyball, the Interlagos Racetrack, host of the Formula 1 Brazilian Grand Prix, and finally, Neo Química Arena in Itaquera, the Corinthians' stadium.\",\"durationStr\":\"4h 18min\",\"distanceStr\":\"201.6 km\",\"stopsCount\":10,\"drivability\":\"moderate\",\"accessibility\":\"partial\",\"bestTime\":[\"morning\",\"afternoon\"],\"languageLabels\":[\"English\",\"Español\",\"Português\",\"Italiano\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"line\":[[-46.71814,-23.52744],[-46.71834,-23.52733],[-46.7187,-23.5272],[-46.71893,-23.52714],[-46.71955,-23.527],[-46.71991,-23.52698],[-46.72024,-23.52694],[-46.72042,-23.5269],[-46.72044,-23.52717],[-46.72029,-23.52738],[-46.72011,-23.52763],[-46.72008,-23.52781],[-46.72001,-23.52821],[-46.72002,-23.52838],[-46.7202,-23.5284],[-46.72039,-23.52845],[-46.7205,-23.52866],[-46.72043,-23.52882],[-46.72027,-23.5289],[-46.72009,-23.52906],[-46.72003,-23.52926],[-46.71996,-23.52948],[-46.71986,-23.52984],[-46.71975,-23.53022],[-46.71964,-23.53058],[-46.71958,-23.5308],[-46.71937,-23.53087],[-46.71844,-23.53126],[-46.71786,-23.53154],[-46.71752,-23.53169],[-46.71718,-23.53183],[-46.71692,-23.53194],[-46.71649,-23.53213],[-46.71545,-23.53259],[-46.71456,-23.533],[-46.71356,-23.53345],[-46.71384,-23.53417],[-46.7139,-23.53432],[-46.71399,-23.53455],[-46.71408,-23.53478],[-46.71424,-23.53519],[-46.71377,-23.5353],[-46.71352,-23.5353],[-46.71328,-23.5353],[-46.71309,-23.5353],[-46.71253,-23.53539],[-46.71212,-23.53545],[-46.71178,-23.53552],[-46.71144,-23.53559],[-46.71069,-23.53575],[-46.71048,-23.53581],[-46.7101,-23.53595],[-46.70987,-23.53603],[-46.70965,-23.53614],[-46.70947,-23.53632],[-46.7094,-23.53651],[-46.7094,-23.53677],[-46.70943,-23.53701],[-46.70937,-23.53723],[-